  "notes": "Dark Spotify-like desktop music client. The album hero is tinted by a vertical gradient derived from the cover art (#732c2b fading to near-black). Primary actions are white pill buttons (play, add to queue, play next) with black icons; the only saturated accent is the electric blue (#0558fd) used for the filled favorite heart and the count badge. Generated abstract cover art (lines/shapes) with title overlaid at bottom. Table settings button opens a modal (verified live) with size Compact/Default/Large segmented control (Compact selected, hence density=compact despite ~40px rows), toggles, and a column chooser with reorder/pin/align/width controls — hence show-and-hide columns. Track table has no row borders; header separated by a thin line. Sidebar sections 'My Library' and 'Playlists' are collapsible."
